<div id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1774253817079" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><div class="faq-split-container">
  
  <div class="faq-intro-column">
    <h2 class="faq-main-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-description">
      <span>&nbsp;</span>
    </div>
  </div>
    <div class="faq-accordion-column">
    
    <div class="accordion-item">
      <button class="accordion-header" type="button">
        <span class="question-text">Will this AI system replace my staff?</span>
        <span class="icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        <div class="content-inner">
          <p><span style="color: #1f1f1f; background-color: #ffffff;">It will not. Our agents are designed to remove the high-friction, repetitive work, allowing your human team to focus on high-value tasks like building relationships with clients. </span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="accordion-item">
      <button class="accordion-header" type="button">
        <span class="question-text">What about security, HIPAA, and compliance?</span>
        <span class="icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        <div class="content-inner">
          <p><span style="color: #1f1f1f; background-color: #ffffff;">We operate a secure system on HIPAA-covered infrastructure and sign a Business Associate Agreement (BAA). Every transcript is scanned by a Compliance Auditor agent, and a Security Loop ensures PII/PHI is redacted at the model boundary. Your data is safer with our system than with the average front-desk laptop.</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="accordion-item">
      <button class="accordion-header" type="button">
        <span class="question-text">What is the difference between your multi-agent system and a standard chatbot?</span>
        <span class="icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        <div class="content-inner">
          <p><span style="color: #1f1f1f; background-color: #ffffff;">Unlike a single agent with a static script, we deliver a team of specialist agents that operate as one Unified Closed-Loop System. This means the agents have a shared memory, hand off work to each other, learn from every conversation, and are reviewed weekly for quality, security, compliance, and accessibility.</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="accordion-item">
      <button class="accordion-header" type="button">
        <span class="question-text">What if the AI makes an error or is unsure about a complex question?</span>
        <span class="icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        <div class="content-inner">
          <p><span style="color: #1f1f1f; background-color: #ffffff;">The system is built to know when to ask for help. A "Human-in-the-Loop" layer includes defined escalation triggers for low model confidence, mentions of safety/sensitive topics, or repeated callbacks from the same caller. We target a hallucination rate of less than 1% and an intent-classification accuracy above 95%.</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="accordion-item">
      <button class="accordion-header" type="button">
        <span class="question-text">How your agents work with my existing vertical-specific software?</span>
        <span class="icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        <div class="content-inner">
          <p><span style="color: #1f1f1f; background-color: #ffffff;">Our agents connect data sources and include integrations to your practice management or scheduling system, phone, calendar, CRM, and review platforms.</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="accordion-item">
      <button class="accordion-header" type="button">
        <span class="question-text">How do your agents securely connect to the tools we already use?</span>
        <span class="icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        <div class="content-inner">
          <p>Through a modern open standard called MCP (Model Context Protocol). Think of it as a universal, secure adapter that lets our agents talk to your scheduling system, CRM, phone, calendar, and review platforms without us building fragile one-off connections for each. Because access is standardized and permissioned, your agents only ever see the data they're scoped to — and every connection is logged and auditable.<br><br></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="accordion-item">
      <button class="accordion-header" type="button">
        <span class="question-text">What is MCP, and how do you use it?</span>
        <span class="icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        <div class="content-inner">
          <p>MCP (Model Context Protocol) is an open standard for connecting AI agents to external systems through a consistent, secure interface—the AI equivalent of a standard port instead of a tangle of custom wiring. We use MCP to connect your agents to your practice management or scheduling software, phone, calendar, CRM, and review platforms. We can add a new integration in days rather than rebuilding from scratch.<br><br><br></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="accordion-item">
      <button class="accordion-header" type="button">
        <span class="question-text">Who owns our data, and where it is stored?</span>
        <span class="icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="accordion-content">
        <div class="content-inner">
          <div style="color: #1d1c1d;">
<div style="color: #1d1c1d;">
<div style="color: #1d1c1d;">
<div style="color: #1d1c1d;">
<div style="color: #1d1c1d;">
<div style="color: #1d1c1d;">
<div style="color: #1d1c1d;">
